# A fold given its operator alone (card fold-bare-arguments, wiki/examples.md "folding")
'sum := fold +; sum [1 2 3]'	6
'product := fold *; product [2 3 4]'	24
'total := reduce +; total [4 5]'	9
'd := fold -; d [10 3 2]'	5
'fold [1 2 3] 0 +'	6
'fold [2 3 4] 1 *'	24
'reduce [1 2 3 4] +'	10
'xs=[5 6]; reduce xs *'	30
